Keep the previous versions of each save slot.

Saving overwrites the slot in place, so a save made before a mistake is
lost as soon as the slot is saved again. With --backuppath=PATH, the save
being overwritten is first moved to PATH/bermuda.NNN/, named after the
time it was made, and only the newest --backups=N (default 10) are kept.

